 60, because he has the medical experience and health, which are strong positive factors.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is B) Lao Zhao.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Identify Selection Criteria:**\n   - Excluded: Under 20, over 60, no earthquake rescue experience.\n   - Preferred: Medical workers, good health.\n\n2. **Evaluate Each Option:**\n   - **A) Xiao Zhang:** Under 20 (excluded) despite rescue experience.\n   - **B) Lao Zhao:** Over 60 (least likely) but has medical experience and is in good health.\n   - **C) Xiao Li:** Within age but lacks specific earthquake rescue experience.\n   - **D) Lao Ma:** Within age but lacks earthquake rescue experience.\n\n3. **Determine Most Likely Candidate:**\n   - B has medical experience and health, which are strong positives, outweighing the age factor.\n\n**Answer:** B) Lao Zhao.",
