nt, but other aspects are still considered. Therefore, the answer should be A.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is:\n\n**A) As a civil servant, the most important thing is actual performance, but other aspects of performance cannot be ignored.**\n\n**Explanation:**\nThe context emphasizes work performance as a key focus in the assessment, while also mentioning other criteria. Option A correctly reflects that performance is prioritized but other aspects are still considered.",
