ively.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is:\n\n**A) Lao zhao is in the advanced stage of liver cancer. The doctors do their best to treat and extend his life at all costs.**\n\n**Explanation:**\nHospice care focuses on providing comfort, controlling symptoms, and improving quality of life for dying patients rather than aggressive treatment to extend life. Option A describes aggressive treatment aimed at prolonging life, which is not in line with the definition of hospice care.",
