is possible.\n\nAlternatively, if B = C, then B = C \u2265 B, which is allowed.\n\nSo, in any case, A can't be equal to C, so option B is impossible.\n\nTherefore, the answer should be option B.\n</think>\n\nThe inconsistent statement is option B, as A cannot have the same power consumption as C due to A being less than B and B being less than or equal to C.\n\n**Answer: B**",
