regulation.\n\nSo, the main idea is that specific industrial policies are crucial for recovery. Therefore, option B seems to be the best fit because it directly addresses the need for targeted policies.\n</think>\n\nThe passage emphasizes the importance of specific industrial policies for economic recovery, highlighting their necessity in addressing the global crisis transmission along industrial chains. \n\n**Answer: B) Emphasize the need to specify targeted industrial policies for economic recovery.**",
