graph is mainly about how the discovery of the crater led scientists to agree on the cause of dinosaur extinction. That points to option B as the correct answer.\n</think>\n\nThe paragraph discusses the discovery of a large crater near the Yucatan Peninsula, which is linked to the extinction of dinosaurs 65 million years ago. This discovery led to a consensus among scientists about the cause of the extinction. \n\n**Answer: B) The discovery of the crater made scientists more consistent with the cause of dinosaur extinction.**",
