cline in willingness to initiate behaviors or make choices.\n\nSo, comparing all options, D seems to best fit the definition of self-depletion phenomenon as it includes long-term work, burnout, and no desire for change or progress.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is D. Wang's situation exemplifies the self-depletion phenomenon as he experiences long-term work leading to burnout and a lack of desire for change or advancement.\n\n**Answer: D**",
